    {
      "id": "sticky-note-doc",
      "name": "API Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 200,
        "content": "## Recipes - Shopping List\n\n**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/recipes-shopping\n\n**Actions:**\n- `get`: Get shopping list\n- `add`: Add single item (name, quantity, unit, category)\n- `add_from_recipe`: Add all ingredients from recipe (recipe_id)\n- `check`: Check/uncheck item (item_id, is_checked)\n- `remove`: Remove item (item_id)\n- `clear`: Clear list (checked_only: true/false)\n\n**Required:** user_id for all actions"
      }
    }
